      "text": "It absorbs light at longer wavelength as compared to <math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>",
